## Constraints

- A Tagging must have exactly one tagger \(gmeow:taggingTagger\)\.
- A Tagging must tag exactly one entity \(gmeow:taggingTagged\)\.
- A Tagging must use exactly one tag \(gmeow:taggingTag\)\.
- A retracted or superseded tagging \(one whose interval has ended\) should set gmeow:displayable false — suppressed from display, never deleted\.

